            "applied_patch": "--- a/rtl/sequence.sv\n+++ b/rtl/sequence.sv\n@@ -45,7 +45,7 @@\n \n     end\n     // if it overflows, set overflow_out to be 1\n-    if(counter_out == 4'b1110)\n+    if(counter_out == 4'b1111)\n     begin\n         overflow_out <= 1'b1;\n     end\n",
